{"v":4,"catch":"BARON 和 MAX 飛上天空，為保護 BIRDLAND 而戰！","desc":"“SKY KID DX”是 NAMCO（“Bandai Namco Entertainment”）於 1986 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n玩家控制BARON和MAX用炸彈和機槍與敵人戰鬥，盤旋飛行躲避敵人的攻擊，一路向基地進發。\n使用炸彈從上方擊敗巨大的堡壘和戰艦！ 支持兩人同時合作。\n此外，還會有前作 SKY KID 沒有的新舞台和新角色。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-03-02","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5df0bef8c205b66016c380c5ba6309e052cf9b96ced68f8384c9ea028e5db7de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/64431f5ed05553b5a594b44d554d2f6a3bac4c1646883cfc47360164f5c0bc74.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/461af19122a9f640c6de67eee79ce79db3306f5fc6187ae1118ead05511ecfb5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb3f6294d9e40227dae7dbf4e684f6104243c6c5bba5dbacef64c6f3a876596c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9aa14e7b14e732c327bc48c7f64cf395bb094d45cb8174e49faa63a232767bf9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0aac8c3db1db3b1863434d18d6f381b08e81798dc2c288edf48d0fc84d03031a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100387019eca000","dlc":[]}